# MinIO stopped publishing free Docker images in October 2025 and removed the
# `minio/minio` repository from Docker Hub in September 2026. s3s runs its E2E
# suites against silo, a community continuation of MinIO: its releases carry
# the GHSA-jjjj-jwhf-8rgr fix and the streaming-flush fix that the last
# published MinIO image lacks, so s3s no longer builds and publishes a backend
# image of its own. silo is a third-party build, not an official MinIO one;
# the digest below pins the release. The file name and the variable name are
# historical: the pin is what names the backend image. Override `MINIO_IMAGE_REF`
# to test another build.
MINIO_IMAGE_REF="${MINIO_IMAGE_REF:-docker.io/pgsty/silo:RELEASE.2026-09-16T00-00-00Z@sha256:635197cb9f36d01bee221d34d1c7d7960f6a95c48b0b6c01d99cd13bdae51a46}"
